      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاطِرٌ</span></b>  A camel <i>whose</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاب</span> [or <i>tush</i>] <i>is coming
forth,</i> (S,) or <i>cleaving the flesh and coming forth.</i>
(TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاطِرُ ٱلسَّمٰوَاتِ وَٱلأَرْضِ</span> [in the Kur xlii.
9, &amp;c.,] means <i>The Originater</i> [or <i>Creator</i>] <i>of
the heavens and of the earth.</i> (I'Ab, S, * TA.)
